       The condition functions are not async‐signal safe, and  should  not  be
       called from a signal handler.  In particular, calling pptthhrreeaadd__ccoonndd__ssiigg‐‐
       nnaall()  or  pptthhrreeaadd__ccoonndd__bbrrooaaddccaasstt()  from a signal handler may deadlock
       the calling thread.

